{"id":"n62979-1-17","stage":1,"title":"상처 · 伤口","scene":"生活与经历","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n62979-1-17-1","ko":"그 상처는 어쩌다 난 거야?","zh":"那个伤口是怎么弄的？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"그","meaning":"那个","explanation":"그：那个。","readings":[{"term":"그","audio":"/audio/38c61820e786f2346e96.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"43883","senseId":"1","lemma":"그","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"그","audio":"/audio/38c61820e786f2346e96.mp3"}},{"text":"상처는","meaning":"伤口，伤","explanation":"상처：伤口，伤；는：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"상처","audio":"/audio/005223fd14eafcaf1ee3.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62979","senseId":"1","lemma":"상처","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"상처는","audio":"/audio/2c8c91e42c6d4eb1fac6.mp3"}},{"text":"어쩌다","meaning":"指“什么”、“怎么”。","explanation":"어쩌다：指“什么”、“怎么”。","readings":[{"term":"어쩌다","audio":"/audio/85a8c2b5d5fccc03afbb.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"29765","senseId":"2","lemma":"어쩌다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"어쩌다","audio":"/audio/85a8c2b5d5fccc03afbb.mp3"}},{"text":"난","meaning":"发生","explanation":"나다：发生；ㄴ：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。","readings":[{"term":"나다","audio":"/audio/1a06e246c5fb49e2814c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62210","senseId":"7","lemma":"나다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"난","audio":"/audio/f123177dde5fa8f48570.mp3"}},{"text":"거야?","meaning":"某种事物、现象或事实。","explanation":"거：某种事物、现象或事实；이다：表示“是”的判断形式；야：非敬语判断或疑问句末，常与 이다 连用。","readings":[{"term":"거","audio":"/audio/ffcedfda7558e5dc31fe.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62331","senseId":"1","lemma":"거","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"거야","audio":"/audio/16592c1618a6826ee403.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"38c61820e786f234","term":"그","zh":"那个","audio":"/audio/38c61820e786f2346e96.mp3","entryId":"43883","definition":"指代与听话人较近或听话人所想的对象。","pronunciation":["그"]},{"id":"005223fd14eafcaf","term":"상처","zh":"伤口，伤","audio":"/audio/005223fd14eafcaf1ee3.mp3","entryId":"62979","definition":"身体受伤而生出的伤处。","pronunciation":["상처"]},{"id":"85a8c2b5d5fccc03","term":"어쩌다","zh":"指“什么”、“怎么”。","audio":"/audio/85a8c2b5d5fccc03afbb.mp3","entryId":"29765","definition":"指“什么”、“怎么”。","pronunciation":["어쩌다"]},{"id":"1a06e246c5fb49e2","term":"나다","zh":"发生","audio":"/audio/1a06e246c5fb49e2814c.mp3","entryId":"62210","definition":"出现某种现象或事件。","pronunciation":["나다"]},{"id":"ffcedfda7558e5dc","term":"거","zh":"某种事物、现象或事实。","audio":"/audio/ffcedfda7558e5dc31fe.mp3","entryId":"62331","definition":"某种事物、现象或事实。","pronunciation":["거"]}],"audio":"/audio/98e3d76d3cf22ce1295e.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n62979-1-17-2","ko":"어제 축구를 하다가 넘어져서 생겼어.","zh":"昨天踢足球的时候摔倒了，才弄成的。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"어제","meaning":"昨天，昨日","explanation":"어제：昨天，昨日。","readings":[{"term":"어제","audio":"/audio/79c5ada11647bce64407.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67075","senseId":"1","lemma":"어제","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"어제","audio":"/audio/79c5ada11647bce64407.mp3"}},{"text":"축구를","meaning":"足球","explanation":"축구：足球；를：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"축구","audio":"/audio/c21dee4a35ad739ca03e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"36700","senseId":"1","lemma":"축구","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"축구를","audio":"/audio/7e9862283e7c11a6abf2.mp3"}},{"text":"하다가","meaning":"做，干","explanation":"하다：做，干；다가：表示原有动作或状态中途转为另一情况。","readings":[{"term":"하다","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73277","senseId":"1","lemma":"하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"하다가","audio":"/audio/4b34e3a9f6a4443fcde6.mp3"}},{"text":"넘어져서","meaning":"跌倒，倒下，摔倒","explanation":"넘어지다：跌倒，倒下，摔倒；어서：连接原因与结果，或前后相接的动作。","readings":[{"term":"넘어지다","audio":"/audio/b95cf11ab79489dac5a0.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62363","senseId":"1","lemma":"넘어지다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"넘어져서","audio":"/audio/10787ebb24047b5bd969.mp3"}},{"text":"생겼어.","meaning":"发生，产生","explanation":"생기다：发生，产生；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"생기다","audio":"/audio/fc2a5a2e23bd6357d176.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67898","senseId":"3","lemma":"생기다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"생겼어","audio":"/audio/489404079ec5d4be0966.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"79c5ada11647bce6","term":"어제","zh":"昨天，昨日","audio":"/audio/79c5ada11647bce64407.mp3","entryId":"67075","definition":"今天的前一天。","pronunciation":["어제"]},{"id":"c21dee4a35ad739c","term":"축구","zh":"足球","audio":"/audio/c21dee4a35ad739ca03e.mp3","entryId":"36700","definition":"由11人组成一队，主要用脚或头把球打入对方球门的比赛，进球多的一方获胜。","pronunciation":["축꾸"]},{"id":"505de0a2f6be73fa","term":"하다","zh":"做，干","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3","entryId":"73277","definition":"进行某种行动、动作或活动。","pronunciation":["하다"]},{"id":"b95cf11ab79489da","term":"넘어지다","zh":"跌倒，倒下，摔倒","audio":"/audio/b95cf11ab79489dac5a0.mp3","entryId":"62363","definition":"站立着的人或物失去重心，倾向一边而倒下。","pronunciation":["너머지다"]},{"id":"fc2a5a2e23bd6357","term":"생기다","zh":"发生，产生","audio":"/audio/fc2a5a2e23bd6357d176.mp3","entryId":"67898","definition":"出现事故或事情、问题等。","pronunciation":["생기다"]}],"audio":"/audio/80b10f022630f6d35569.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.19,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=62979","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"초급","day":37,"sequenceScore":1.6407,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["那个伤口是怎么弄的？","昨天踢足球的时候摔倒了，才弄成的。","你现在在哪儿？"],"answer":0},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["那个伤口是怎么弄的？","昨天踢足球的时候摔倒了，才弄成的。","你现在在哪儿？"],"answer":1}]}
